+Source/build/user-install review appends to .review/operations.log.
+System installation appends to /var/log/fan-control-center-install.log.
+GUI diagnostics append to ~/.local/state/fan-control-center/gui.log, respecting
+XDG_STATE_HOME. The native C service accepts fixed, validated commands through
+a Unix socket accessible only to the installing user and root. No network
+service or interpreter-based model service is used.
+
+## Remove
+
+~~~sh
+cd /home/kaal/fan-control-center
+sudo ./install.sh --remove-system
+./install.sh --remove-user
+~~~
+
